# What the markdown stack pack puts into a repository.
# See core/manifest.list for the format and the modes.
#
# No `+shared/<pack>` line: there is no second Markdown stack to share with.
# No editorconfig.block either - the core pack already sets [*.md], and its
# trim_trailing_whitespace = false is deliberate, because two trailing spaces
# are a line break in Markdown.

AGENTS.markdown.md|AGENTS.markdown.md|managed

templates/gates.sh|.devkit/gates.sh|template
